==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 63.33 seconds<sup>1,900f</sup>.
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 63.33 seconds<sup>1,900f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Treat this like your average early [[Legend Stages|Stories of Legend]] stage. Bringing the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] + [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] (or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] if you have him) should be enough to win.

